in our brain, in our Spanish-speaking brain, double L,

00:04:03.211 --> 00:04:05.130
<v Orlando>now a lot of times looks like a CH.

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:06.250
<v Orlando>Not always, but a lot of times.

