00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:12.550
<v Valdo><lang pt-BR>Chamar.</lang>

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:14.570
<v Orlando>So <lang es>llamar</lang> becomes <lang pt-BR>chamar</lang>.

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:16.050
<v Orlando>How about the verb to arrive?

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:17.250
<v José Luis><lang es>Llegar.</lang>

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:18.800
<v Valdo><lang pt-BR>Chegar.</lang>

00:04:18.850 --> 00:04:20.800
<v Orlando>The word "full".

00:04:20.850 --> 00:04:22.050
<v José Luis><lang es>Lleno.</lang>

00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:23.630
<v Valdo><lang pt-BR>Cheio.</lang>

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:25.050
<v Orlando>And the word for "rain".

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:25.940
