00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:38.550
<v Valdo>Which is pronounced "sh". <lang pt-BR>Chuva</lang>, <lang pt-BR>cheio</lang>, <lang pt-BR>chamar</lang>, <lang pt-BR>chegar</lang>.

